    {
      "id": "993a391b-cd3a-44dc-be36-3d0f6d152f79",
      "title": "Leia a nota curta e associe a terminação ao grupo certo.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 4,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "3af43ea5-a92e-4820-93af-7ca80a25ff60",
          "textContent": "<p>Nos verbos em <strong>-er</strong>, a forma de <strong>nosotros / nosotras</strong> termina em <strong>-emos</strong>.</p><p>Use essa forma quando o grupo inclui quem fala.</p><p><strong>comer -&gt; comemos</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "a6a534af-c1c0-4716-abd6-4908b78e8789",
      "title": "Observe a frase, ouça o áudio e veja a tradução.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 5,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "b3bdfedc-c9d3-4673-b47b-b2ed365574a1",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Salimos de fiesta los viernes.</strong></p><p>Em português: Nós saímos para festejar às sextas-feiras.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/4ba2f2d52aea4859a9c96ea362902fb1_b04-salimos-de-fiesta-los-viernes.mp3?Expires=1794099461&Signature=sewseZUn5lpaKUzS8csVhC9BRumIDXL5Zx2hRXZOgOLx2CcpAaQu5oCSnlM6dsvy6peHzIfb6ckopHg2X-t20nCQjua~RBfusCwaCj3dFk15UTBnLlSsjn4z~EOj2r6ov7Cp0TLTadSZ00ig7Tl7khyH8C43LnUMizQDzqAyMv4noeglKtuGwRYuGMrvxwnAVrjPhKAB4teno-R5FppqGY3uQMcshJHN-XNwcWrgGwnheUO5bbZ8h5ayxuVjzcQ4Vb6A8X1BeiKl-tOm8BJtffP2zt1AdVkxtj8hHOrOMoC04km4IJN0rhZZvQzT0d30Ync6D375ecKXaqsYFs0bGA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "98b86888-038e-41e7-8b91-3f0ce7749d2c",
      "title": "Observe as duas formas e repare no que muda entre -er e -ir.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 6,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "c6edc54b-d9c9-4875-91ae-cc7f3f4a0b32",
          "textContent": "<p>Com <strong>nosotros / nosotras</strong>, o plural muda conforme a família do verbo.</p><ul><li><strong>-er</strong>: <strong>comemos</strong></li><li><strong>-ir</strong>: <strong>salimos</strong></li></ul><p>As duas formas falam de um grupo que inclui quem fala.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "88abf3f2-1775-41db-a449-65e75707338a",
      "title": "Observe a frase, ouça o áudio e veja a tradução.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 7,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "263c211a-ba73-426a-92fc-84e28820cf00",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Vosotros coméis pizza hoy.</strong></p><p>Em português: Vocês comem pizza hoje.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/a35812e404444230817f7306743bb8c0_b06-vosotros-comeis-pizza-hoy.mp3?Expires=1794099461&Signature=L0ENecDiMe7aTuT0TUDOL9npyAhN5U8xH455xBKxdozpWbFDr~si9K1yWTD25qgTolSqxPe4Y41AOuSnOraZcyNuPT3e8XaeobtV2uileyYOBP0AQd7JBoo9iPkgOUTeSU249cQzuxFxvD3r1~QUNyYqttSOf~D7rP8DhS3XVfp8rqIgeUbM2a~~-9GFm3MLActK9htShQ3oT19LlqXVRGk1E8JbCo88ADOCjf2W7nt6u~F779u5nH-9p-FLuPD2~areq7N34NW9hQ-JniDhJ-cS7EDb6BwCosKE7XcWrlmvgpUOVCmsFCSiazwSsOy4YO57d1FlHCsneoBq5BIGgQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
